 most of your team got killed and now you must crawl back to the Iron Council and report what you saw there.\nOnly you and Norgan, a fellow Dwarf berserker, have survived, but the orcs will not let you go easily.\n\nYou have sworn that once you reach the Iron Council safely you will take on a life of adventure, looking for fame and treasures of old.\nAway from all those orcs....\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#！\n你是骄傲而神秘的矮人一族。\n你来自于钢铁王座的矮人帝国，被派去调查古老的瑞库纳堡垒，那里已被兽人占领。\n\n抵达瑞库纳后，你的大部分队友都被杀害了；你必须设法返回钢铁议会，报告在那里所见的一切。\n只有诺尔甘——一个矮人狂战士和你幸存了下来，但是兽人不会让你们轻而易举的逃走。\n\n你发誓，假如你能活着回到钢铁议会，你会开始你的冒险生涯，去寻求名声和古老的宝藏。\n\n远离那些兽人……\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"25b9d99451afd80fc971751d94fa480aa8437ebe5dab8ff756ec1d6b8665a123","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"73963008713f0aece70651dbfa12b87ba70e59c35ed8fcc79ccbbb232aea3fdd","logical_entry_identity":"9f16ce2fe25b00838db06a36dd238347caaaed400626ba346786c91bd46ad087","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Shards of metal explode from %s's shield!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"金属碎片从%s的盾牌中爆出！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1ce42e1eac33d79533621995bf3c2c852b03bf140ea3e7dcf64fd49e483a5009","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7396ee06a48b1cc31a7af73e2238bd5e5f6a176b928d45248df9c28ef1fcc169","logical_entry_identity":"13e4775566fe678ee489da00d8bc378aabcb2755d9413e0e1fafa394db536234","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# turns into a shivgoroth!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#变成了西弗格罗斯！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"93899b1524b7c0df73b261e495ac3ed27a5770761f8884bf615d03cc67fb873b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"73980559e7bce3b5bff21387bf49c09e2453c0c515fcf735a7aa24a25d62283e","logical_entry_identity":"c85229788ab9dba78dfaaf9e00c00b06c8c87f53ed11b4a1b5fbb9cfb3b12482","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"oozing blades","source_tag":"talent type","target":"软泥利刃"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fe216a000f6e64779b681accaa60f629b8e94cf